Starting point: this driver started from the Libre 3 support of Trio
(https://github.com/nightscout/Trio). Trio takes that support from LibreLoop
through a git submodule, https://github.com/loopandlearn/LibreLoop (branch
legacy-loopkit-compat). Trio itself vendors no driver code. The code that was
ported comes from the two projects in sections 1 and 2.

Scope of this module: Libre 3 and Libre 3 Plus only. No Libre 2 / Libre 2 Plus
code is added here. The existing follower paths (xDrip, Glimp, Tomato, and the
LIBRE_2 / LIBRE_2_NATIVE / LIBRE_3 enum entries) are untouched.


