    Sources/LibreCRKit/Resources/RuntimeTables, and Pairing/PhoneCert.swift)

  All 36 files under src/commonMain/resources/libre3/, 1,827,181 bytes:

    phone_cert_162b.bin (162 bytes, family prefix 03 03) — the phone
      certificate sent during a first pairing. The same file was also in the
      LibreLoop repository at the pin e4a4642 (LibreLoop/Resources/).
    libaes_5defec_round1_tables_26f621.bin, libaes_final_key_tables_276cfc.bin,
    libaes_final_table_index_277cfc.bin, libaes_final_table_map_277d3c.bin,
