4. What is NOT in this module
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  * No Abbott shared object (.so), no Abbott APK content, no Abbott binary of
    any kind is shipped or loaded at run time. The tables in 3c are data files
    read by the Kotlin code of this module.
  * No Juggluco source (Java, C++, tables, cert loaders). Juggluco is named in
    user-facing text only as an app to close before connecting; that is not code
    derivation.
  * No Libre 2 / Libre 2 Plus protocol code, and no Libre 2 UUIDs.
  * No Dexcom, Eversense or xDrip code.
  * The source files in this module that are not listed in section 3 (driver
    facade and registry, reconnect policy, scan budget, MAC arbiter,
    disconnect and session start policies, logging, the Android platform code
    other than the files named above) were written for AndroidAPS. The two
    files in 3d are written for AndroidAPS too, but follow the upstream in the
    parts named there.


